{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.lazy",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她瘫在练习室的地板上",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.lazy",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.fuyuko.lazy",
    "idolId": "fuyuko",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "哈～～……好累～……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "明明是这么好的天气，之后却要一直上课……好麻烦啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "冬優子……现在这样懒着可以，但上课时要好好做啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "烦死了……麻烦就是麻烦嘛。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "而且，偶像的课为什么那么严啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "ふゆ明明照着节奏跳对了。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "『手指没伸开』『姿势不好』，连细节都要说……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是跳对了就行。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……哈？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "动作对了，但看起来不对。差别就在那些细节里。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "（她没反驳，只是别过脸去。）",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……知道了啦。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "起来吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "刚才那段，再来一次。",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "先说说你在气什么。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……真是的，催什么催。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "好啦，起来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嘴上抱怨，动作倒是不慢。）"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "现在？……哈，好吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "那我跳一遍，你看着。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（这次她没有偷懒。）"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……没在气什么。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "只是，被说\"看起来不对\"，有点不甘心。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那就把\"看起来\"改对。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……知道了。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
